OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm lucky to be alive': Woman's
OL,4,Awarning over black market weight-loss
OL,5,Ajabs
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has described how she could not
OL,8,Fspeak or stand before being rushed to
OL,9,Fhospital after taking an unlicensed
OL,10,Fweight-loss jab.
OL,12,FKay Roscoe, 38, from Birkenhead, said
OL,13,Fshe had used a substance sold as
OL,14,Fretatrutide, or "reta", for two months
OL,15,Fbefore falling seriously ill.
OL,17,FThe experimental drug is not approved
OL,18,Ffor general use and is available only
OL,19,Fthrough clinical trials. Products
OL,20,Fclaiming to contain it are widely sold
OL,21,Fonline, but it is not known whether Kay
OL,22,Ftook genuine retatrutide.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
